  "description": "YITAMOTOR is one of the largest automotive running boards and vehicle accessories retailers in the United States. We take pride in our quality control to assuring that providing only the highest quality running boards and auto accessories to our customers.\nFitment\n2024-2026 Toyota Tacoma Double Cab with 4 full-size doors\nFeatures\nIMPORTANT - This running board side step is compatible with the 2024-2026 Toyota Tacoma Double Cab with 4 full-size doors. Please check the Cab Size picture before ordering\nPRACTICAL DESIGN - 6.5\" wide stylish black stainless steel pad provides a textured surface for excellent footing. Each side can support up to 450 lb\nSUPER QUALITY - The running boards' structure provides strength and durability. The 6-inch non-slip injection step pad allows easy movement such as stepping in, stepping out, and even jumping (450 lb. capacity)\nSUPREME FUNCTIONALITY - Made from Stainless Steel and pre-treated with rust-resistant powder coatings. One-piece design ensures excellent performance and looks for years to come\nEASY TO INSTALL - Easy bolt-on installation with no drilling required. All factory holes are perfectly aligned with the mounts; bolts to factory mount in less than an hour\nProfessional installation recommended",
